{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：14:18 2026-05-25 HKT<br/>發佈時間：14:18 2026-05-25 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：14:18 2026-05-25 HKT</p><p>今(25日)下午近2時，青葵公路發生交通意外，一部960號路線九巴與一部工程車相撞，據報逾20人受傷，當中大部分為巴士乘客，多部救護車前往營救。</p><img alt=\"九巴車頭嚴重損毀。劉漢權攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3a48a125f5bdf12f736be635c52638a7/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260525_142842122_02.jpg\"/><img alt=\"九巴車頭嚴重損毀。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5a721eff1e5a36bdf8e06849cf1cbecf/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260525_142842122_03.jpg\"/><img alt=\"九巴直撞工程車車尾。劉漢權攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7d32df0d50867e10ee93a70218a33be9/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260525_142842122_05.jpg\"/><img alt=\"傷者清醒送院。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c2e2a515f2d465b679b1c6d720d6aba0/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260525_142842122_06.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ce2a7906a6aa087b25b907fc95376872/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260525_142842122_07.jpg\"/><img alt=\"傷者待援。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c95a872f74c5e533b6354709a9778eea/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260525_142842122_08.jpg\"/><img alt=\"意外中多名乘客受傷。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7997650b2e7abc95768a0d216cc620bb/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260525_142842122_10.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e87966e23810a95d9226aff32653ded3/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260525_142842122_11.jpg\"/><p>現場所見，九巴車頭嚴重損毀，車頭擋風玻璃爆裂，多名乘客受傷，仍然清醒。</p><p>因交通意外，青葵公路(往機場方向)近瑪嘉烈醫院的部分行車線現已封閉。駕駛人士只可使用餘下行車線行車。現時上址交通繁忙。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-25T06:39:11.103135+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":251,"images":8,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}